# str-substr: start+len past end raises a descriptive error
[include %libdir "strings.llt"]
---
[call %.str-substr 3 5 "hello"]
=== error
[E080] str-substr: end position 8 exceeds string length 5 (defined at stdlib/prelude.llt:2051:28-2051:47)
  --> stdlib/prelude.llt:2051:28-2051:47
   |
  2051 | """]: [fn [let msg@String] [builtin-raise msg]]
       |                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  in [builtin-raise ...] at stdlib/prelude.llt:2051:28-2051:47
   |
  2051 | """]: [fn [let msg@String] [builtin-raise msg]]
       |                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  in materialized at 88:5-94:43
  in [if ...] at 92:13-94:41
  in [if ...] at 90:9-94:42
  in [if ...] at 88:5-94:43
  in [<dot-access> ...] at 3:1-3:32
